
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Job Opportunities</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 30px 16px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f6f8;
      color: #222;
    }

    .job-card {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 24px;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e1e5e9;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }

    .job-label {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      background: #e8f5e9;
      color: #216e39;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 16px 0 10px;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .location {
      color: #5c6670;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .details {
      margin: 22px 0;
      padding: 16px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      line-height: 2;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .description {
      color: #4b5563;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .job-button {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 22px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #2557a7;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 7px;
    }

    .job-button:hover {
      background: #194580;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="job-card">
    <span class="job-label">NOW HIRING</span>

    <h1>Job Title Goes Here</h1>

    <p class="location">📍 Your State, United States</p>

    <div class="details">
      <div><strong>Job Type:</strong> Full-time</div>
      <div><strong>Salary:</strong> See job details</div>
      <div><strong>Work Location:</strong> On-site</div>
      <div><strong>Posted:</strong> Recently</div>
    </div>

    <p class="description">
      We are looking for a dependable and motivated candidate
      to join our team. Review the full job description and
      requirements by clicking the button below.
    </p>

    <a class="job-button"
       href="https://example.com"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer">
      View Job Details →
    </a>

    <div class="footer">
      Please review the full job description before applying.
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
